# =====================================================================
# StochasticGoose – CNN-based action learning agent
# Source: https://github.com/DriesSmit/ARC3-solution
# Authors: Dries Smit (Lead), Jack Cole (Adviser) — Tufa Labs
#
# Compatibility notes:
